Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:05.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（至今走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.65,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一生都在寻找这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, our whole lives we've been searching for this demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在终于有了线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We finally know where this demon's gonna be…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也知道如何结果它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now we know how to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ends now. I'm ending it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论用什么方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what method.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管我看到没看到 事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visions or no visions, the fact is…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个恶魔今晚就会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}the demon is coming tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而那家人会像我们一样经历一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this family's gonna go through the same hell we went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道你有那把枪 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you have the gun, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你刚刚是在向我们宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just declared war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会给你们柯尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll bring you the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个恶魔今晚就会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只有那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gun is all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想给梅格一把假枪 指望她不会发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand Meg a fake gun, hope she doesn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们等待这一仗很长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting a long time for this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 今晚没人会死 我们不会 那家人也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's dying tonight. Not us, not that family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不把枪交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you hand over the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我该射你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe l'll just shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来的可不止我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more where I came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信你竟然射了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you just shot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是赝品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 让我去 它还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go. It's still in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你进去就是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get in there It's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}l do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那东西杀死了杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing killed Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀死了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing killed Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.57,0:01:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们都已经不在了 再也不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone. And they're never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经历了那么多事 不许你再这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you say that.Not after all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩这次可真把事给搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys really screwed up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们永远也见不到你们父亲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna see your father again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们抓住了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd she say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:01:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚跟你说了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}l just told you, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.35,0:01:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:01:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干嘛 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那个恶魔知道我们在拯救郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon knows we're in Salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还知道柯尔特在我们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It knows we've got the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在它抓了爸爸 很可能下一个就来找咱们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got Dad. It's coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那才好 我们还有三发子弹 让它来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. We've got three bullets left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 勇士 我们还没有准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也不知道它们有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know how many of them are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我们死了 就什么也做不成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we're no good to anybody dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走… 立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 迪恩 我们可以结果那家伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm telling you, we could've taken them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要的是一个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we need is a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关键是它们还没杀死爸爸 我们要找到关他的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably keeping Dad alive. Just gotta figure out where.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们想用爸爸来换枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll wanna trade him for the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果真是那样的话 为什么梅格一点不提交易的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if that were true. why didn't Meg mention a trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 爸爸他可能 - 不要说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, he might be - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不愿意这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't wanna believe it any more than you…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果真是这样 我们就更该杀了这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if he is, all the more reason to kill this damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柯尔特还在我们手上 我们还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have the Colt. We can finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在不是谈这件事的时候 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw the job, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我只是觉得该做爸爸想让我们做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to do what he'd want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一定会希望我们继续的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would want us to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能不能别再说得好像他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit talking about him like he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们救他回来之前 其他一切免谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything stops until we get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白吗 一切事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那你准备怎么找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去林肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go to Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.07,0:03:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从他被抓走的那个仓库开始找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start at the warehouse where he was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真觉得恶魔会在那里留下线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You really think these demons are gonna leave a trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 它不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么东西 圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那瓶是 这瓶是威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one is. This is whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 鲍比 感谢你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, thanks. Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说真的 我不知道我们该不该来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wasn't sure if we should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别说傻话 你们父亲需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense. Your daddy needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上次我们来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but last time we saw you, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的确威胁说要用铅弹打爆他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}you did threaten to blast him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还把散弹枪什么的都用上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cocked the shotgun and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 没错 我不否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, what can I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰就是有那种能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}John just has that effect on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 他的确有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在过去的都不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of that matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一要紧的是 你们能把他救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that matters is that you get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鲍比 这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, this book…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没读到过类似的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所罗门之钥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key of Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话 这些才是真东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the real deal, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些保护圈 真的有用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these These protective circles, they really work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果一个魔怪进入其中 它就被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a demon in one, they're trapped. Powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}变得毫无法力 这就像个恶魔监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a satanic roach motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放心吧 这个人知道自己在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man knows his stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还要告诉你们一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you something else too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们将要对付的东西非常棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some serious crap you boys stepped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那会是怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以往一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normal year, I hear of…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约只有三起魔鬼附身的事件发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}say, three demonic possessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 最多四起 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe four, tops. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但今年 目前为止 我已经听到27起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This year, I heard of 27 so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get what l'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.33,0:05:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越来越多的魔鬼出现在人间 远远超过以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}More and more demons are walking among us.A lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道 但我确定会有大事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I know it's something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}山雨欲来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你们和你们父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you boys and your daddy…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正处于漩涡中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are smack in the middle of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉姆斯·菲尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumsfeld.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们别再废话了 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more crap, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要柯尔特 萨姆 真正的柯尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the Colt, Sam.The real Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不在我们身上 我们把它埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have it on us. We buried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得已经说过「别再废话」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I say, "No more crap"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 在和你们一家人打交道这么久之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, after everything I heard about you Winchesters…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须说 我对你们已经没有任何兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l gotta tell you, I'm a little underwhelmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.63,0:06:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先是约翰想用把假枪忽悠我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Johnny tries to pawn off a fake gun…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他还把真枪留给了你们这两个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he leaves the real gun with you two chuckleheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}极不明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lackluster, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说 你们真以为我找不到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, did you really think I wouldn't find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 我们正等着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we were counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道么 如果你们想要我留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you wanted to tie me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要说一句就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all you had to do was ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在窗户和门前都撒了盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I salted the doors and windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使她还有帮手 它们也进不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there are any demons out there, they aingt getting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的爸爸在哪里 Meg\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's our father, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你问得不够有礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't ask very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的爸爸在哪里 婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's our father, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 你就用那张嘴亲你母亲的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, you kiss your mother with that mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我忘了 你没那机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I forgot. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这只是个吓唬你的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you think this is a frigging game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪 你们把他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he What did you do to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他尖叫着死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲手杀的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那真叫人吃惊 你竟然打女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of a turn on, you hitting a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说谎 他没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lying. He's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 你要小心点对付她 别伤着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you gotta be careful with her. Don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.89,0:08:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为她的确是个女孩子 那就是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she really is a girl, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.87,0:08:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她只是被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是个被魔鬼附身的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a human possessed by a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们看不出吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是想告诉我有个无辜的女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to tell me there's an innocent girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被困在那个身体里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}trapped somewhere in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.50,0:08:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.97,0:09:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要给我读故事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna read me a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多 开始吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that. Hit it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驱逐咒 你没开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}An exorcism Are you serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的没错 宝贝 头晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going for it, baby. Head spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目眩 呕吐 痛苦可多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}projectile vomiting, the whole nine yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.90,0:09:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把你剥皮拆骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna rip the bones from your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你会死在地狱的烈火中\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're gonna burn in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非你告诉我们 我们爸爸在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you tell us where our dad is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.23,0:09:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 至少你能得到身不错的黑皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least you'll get a nice tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他满含着眼泪 乞求不要杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He begged for his life with tears in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乞求见你们两个最后一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He begged to see his sons one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那时我割断了他的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I slit his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为你自己着想 我希望你说的不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your sake, I hope you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则的话 我向上帝发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if it's true, I swear to God…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定亲自去地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}l will march into hell myself and I will slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撕碎你们这群狗娘养的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}each and every one of you evil sons of bitches, so help me, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是不接受「他死了」这个事实 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just won't take dead for an answer. Where is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死了 不 他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead No, he's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没死 他不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dead. He can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在看什么？继续读啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at Keep reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! What.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在我们对他做的事情完成后 他就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he will be after what we do to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们怎么知道你说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know you're telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:11:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 一栋建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! A building,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了吧 一栋建筑 在\N{\fnArial\fs30}okayA building in Jefferson City.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}密苏里州 在哪 在哪 我要地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missouri Where, where An address.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在找的那个恶魔 它在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the demon. Where is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.77,0:12:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是全部了 我就知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's everything. That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 我说的全是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I told you the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个混蛋 你保证过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch, you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}l lied!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也许还能利用她来找那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can still use her. Find out where the demon is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她都说不知道了 她说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She doesn't know. She lied!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何况那里还有个无辜的女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, there's an innocent girl trapped in there and we've gotta help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你这么做会杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.27,0:12:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说过 她曾从大楼上坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said she fell from a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女孩的身体已经损坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl's body is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:13:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她之所以还活着 仅仅是因为那个魔鬼还附在她身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing keeping her alive is that demon inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你驱逐了它 那个女孩也就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You exorcise it, the girl is gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们也不能让她永远那样活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not gonna leave her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.63,0:13:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要把她从痛苦中解脱出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna put her out of her misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 结果它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打911 找些水和毯子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call 911. Get some water and blankets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}慢慢来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 我们让她躺下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's- Let's get her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotcha. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}慢慢说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时我醒着 能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been awake for some of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不能控制自己的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't move my own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做的那些事 简直是恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And things looked It telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于爸爸的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the truth about our dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点我们需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但它要… 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wants you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们就等着你们去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want you to come for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要爸爸还活着 这些都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Dad's still alive, none of that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在找的那个恶魔在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the demon we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是另外一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更可怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awful ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们把他关在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they keeping our dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在河… 河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the riv- River.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Sunrise\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「Sunrise」 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise What does that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:17:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在医护人员赶来前 你们最好赶快离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hurry up and beat it before the paramedics get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要怎么跟他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是认为只有你们才知道怎么对警察说谎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you guys invented lying to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会想好故事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.93,0:17:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个 你们拿着 可能用得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take this.You might need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢… 为所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保重 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be careful, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找到你们父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just go find your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到他后 别忘了把他带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you do, you bring him around, would you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次我不会想打死他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't even try to shoot him this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一直没说什么话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是在做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会没事的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be fine, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 你在我的车上画什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what are you drawing on my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那叫做恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a devil's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}魔怪们无法通过或进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons can't get through it or inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基本说来 这可以把我们的车变成一个保险箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically turns the trunk into a lockbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们去救爸爸的时候就有地方藏柯尔特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have a place to hide the Colt while we go get Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么 我们要带上柯尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninto a lockbox.We're bringing the Colt with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只剩三发子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only got three bullets left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能随便用柯尔特来对付其他恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just use them on any demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.50,0:18:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须用它来对付那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta use them on the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我们要救出爸爸 萨姆 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we have to save Dad, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要所有可能用得上的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.23,0:19:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们用完所有子弹 你知道爸爸会有多生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how pissed Dad would be if we used all the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 他不会希望我们带上枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He wouldn't want us to bring the gun. l.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在乎 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't care Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不管爸爸怎么想 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what Dad wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且你从什么时候开始关心他的想法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when do you care what Dad wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要杀了那个恶魔 你以前也是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanna kill this demon. You used to want that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.83,0:19:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天 是你来学校找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you're the one who came and got me at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你又把我拖进了这档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who dragged me back into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在只是在尽力结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你和爸爸比我想象中有更多的共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Dad are more alike than I thought, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩都迫不及待地想要在这一件事上牺牲自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both can't wait to sacrifice yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你知不知道 我将会是埋葬你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what I'm gonna be the one to bury you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很自私 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's selfish, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了报仇 你不在乎其他任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't care about anything but revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是那样的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望救出爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Dad back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但它们就等着我们带上枪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are expecting us to bring this gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它们得到了枪 我们就都死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get the gun, they will kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柯尔特是我们唯一的筹码 这你是知道的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Colt is our only leverage and you know it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能带上它 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot bring that gun. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.73,0:20:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我说真的 迪恩 - 我说「好吧」 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm serious, Dean. - I said fine, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.39,0:20:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我知道梅格所说的「Sunrise」什么意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know what Meg meant by "sunrise."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}混蛋 它们真够狡猾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch. It's pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这些魔鬼能附身人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these demons can possess people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们可能附身于任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can possess anybody inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:20:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后让他们袭击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and make anybody attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个充满人肉盾牌的地方 我们没法杀死它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so we can't kill them. A building full of human shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们八成知道我们长什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They probably know what we look like too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这招真毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 那么 我们怎么进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so how the hell are we gonna get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉响火警 让不相干的人都撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the fire alarm. Get out all the civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这样消防队会来 大约7分钟是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but then the city responds in what, seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 7分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven minutes exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.20,0:22:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 怎么了 着火了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, What's happening Is it a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.43,0:22:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正在检查 先生 靠后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're figuring that out now, sir. Just stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我养了只约克狗在楼上 一紧张它就会尿尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got a Yorkie upstairs.He pees when he's nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 你必须靠后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you have to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.23,0:23:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾经梦想长大后当消防员的\N{\fnArial\fs30}l always wanted to be a fireman when I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.93,0:23:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点你从没和我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.99,0:23:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是消防员 需要你们撤离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the fire department. We need you to evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.93,0:24:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.48,0:24:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.89,0:24:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还有呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.89,0:25:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 等等 等一下 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. Wait. - What.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.39,0:25:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说不定也被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be possessed, for all we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 你是不是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.00,0:25:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 这点必须确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. We gotta be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.47,0:25:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.03,0:25:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么往我身上洒水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you splashing water on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.33,0:25:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们迷昏了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been drugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.86,0:25:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柯尔特在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.53,0:25:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要担心 爸爸 我们藏在安全的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Dad.It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好孩子 好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boys. Good boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.06,0:26:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 伙计 你不能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy. You can't go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.29,0:26:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退后 从后面走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back, back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.29,0:26:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.13,0:26:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.25,0:27:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.94,0:27:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.99,0:27:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起来 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.50,0:27:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 我们必须离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.71,0:28:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.21,0:28:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只是需要休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just needed a little rest, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.87,0:28:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.87,0:28:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.84,0:28:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 我们应该没被跟踪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you don't think we were followed here, do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.84,0:28:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我想应该没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.77,0:29:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我找不到 比这里更偏远的地方来躲藏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find more here than in remote places to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.01,0:29:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.31,0:29:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.17,0:29:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那里救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.17,0:29:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我猜你该为我带了枪感到高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess you're glad I brought the gun, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.81,0:29:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是在说谢谢你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, l'm trying to thank you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.17,0:29:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.31,0:29:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.31,0:29:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.81,0:29:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道我射杀的那个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that guy I shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.97,0:29:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是一个人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a person in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.21,0:29:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当时没有选择 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have a choice, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.21,0:30:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 真正困扰我的不是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. That's not what bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.54,0:30:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what does.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀死那个人 杀死梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing that guy, killing Meg…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.81,0:30:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一点没有犹豫 甚至没有一点退缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't hesitate. I didn't even flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.74,0:30:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了你和爸爸 我愿意做任何事 杀任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, for you or Dad, the things I'm willing to do or kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.74,0:30:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个事实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.07,0:30:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时让我自己都感到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scares me sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.41,0:30:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不该这样想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.07,0:30:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.27,0:30:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.64,0:30:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.24,0:30:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我用了颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.84,0:30:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生气 我为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.91,0:31:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆和我 对这事都过于执着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and l, we can get pretty obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.15,0:31:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有你- 你一直守护着这个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you- You You watch out for this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.94,0:31:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.21,0:31:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.47,0:31:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它找上门来了 那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt found us. It's here. The demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.44,0:31:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 每扇窗每扇门前都撒上盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, lines of salt. In front of every window, every door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.91,0:31:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l already did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.24,0:31:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那检查一下 行吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, check it. Okay - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.01,0:31:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 枪在你那 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, you got the gun Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.04,0:31:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把它给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.65,0:31:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆在拯救郡的时候试图射它 但它消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam tried to shoot the demon and it vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.20,0:31:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的 我不会射偏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me. I won't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.87,0:31:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在把枪给我 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the gun. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.77,0:31:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儿子 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.21,0:32:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把枪给我 你在犹豫什么 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the gun. What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.87,0:32:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该火冒三丈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.46,0:32:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.44,0:32:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我浪费了一颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I wasted a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.84,0:32:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不会为我骄傲的 他会把我大骂一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't be proud of me. He'd tear me a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.27,0:32:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.44,0:32:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.50,0:32:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我比任何人都了解我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know my dad better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.31,0:32:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是他 你中什么邪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You aingt him. What's gotten into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个问题该问你 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could ask you the same thing. Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.77,0:32:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. What the hell's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.44,0:32:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你哥哥他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.44,0:32:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.61,0:32:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.37,0:32:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为他被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.11,0:32:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从我们发现他时 他就被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been possessed since we rescued him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.71,0:32:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别听他的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen.Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.17,0:32:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 你怎知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, how do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.80,0:32:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's- He's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.45,0:32:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没有时间讨论这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.55,0:32:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 如果你想杀死那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you wanna kill this demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.75,0:32:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就必须相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.01,0:32:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.71,0:33:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.90,0:33:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.74,0:33:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.51,0:33:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然你们都那么确定 开枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're both so sure.Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.90,0:33:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.24,0:33:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.27,0:34:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件事竟然变得这么难缠\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a pain in the assthis thing's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.01,0:34:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经找你很长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been looking for you a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.57,0:34:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得不错 你们找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.84,0:34:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但圣水的事怎么解释？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the holy water…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.24,0:34:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得那种东西有可能伤到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think something like thatworks on something like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.31,0:34:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.47,0:34:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 那真是个不错的恐吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that would be a neat trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.94,0:34:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 枪就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.64,0:34:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让它飞到你跟前呀 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the gun float to you there, psychic boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.94,0:34:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.64,0:34:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天我不止一次能够杀死你 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've killed youa hundred times today, but this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.04,0:34:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这还是值得等待的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.11,0:35:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爸爸 他正和我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad, he's in here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.51,0:35:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被困在他自己的这副皮囊里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped inside his own meat suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.34,0:35:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便说一句 他向你们问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says hi, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.74,0:35:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要撕碎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna tear you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.34,0:35:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他要尝尝你血的味道 - 离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gonna taste the iron in your blood. - Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.61,0:35:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 否则我向上帝发誓 - 干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or I swear to God- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.37,0:35:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和上帝能做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you and God gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.61,0:35:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看吧 对我来说 这才叫正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, as far as I'm concerned, this is justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.64,0:35:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得那个被你们驱逐的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that little exorcismof yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.31,0:35:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.21,0:35:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谁 梅格 - 巷子里的那个？？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who, Meg? - The one in the alley…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.81,0:35:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.97,0:35:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.47,0:35:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你在开什么玩笑 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gotta be kidding me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.74,0:35:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有你才能有家庭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only onethat can have a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.27,0:36:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你毁了我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You destroyed my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.81,0:36:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我杀了你的家人 你会怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you feel ifI killed your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.01,0:36:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.51,0:36:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我忘了 我已经做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.81,0:36:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 一尸不能抵两命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, two wrongs don't make a right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.84,0:36:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.34,0:36:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要知道原因 你为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wanna know why.Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.91,0:36:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是说为什么杀了妈咪和漂亮的小杰西 - 没错？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, why did I kill Mommy and pretty little Jess? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.71,0:36:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I never told you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.40,0:36:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但萨姆将会向她求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Sam was gonna ask her to marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.24,0:36:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就会整日陪她购物买戒指什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been shopping for ringsand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.07,0:36:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想知道原因吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.77,0:36:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为她们太碍事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.74,0:36:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}碍着什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln the way of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.81,0:36:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为你制定的计划萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plans for you, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.10,0:36:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你… 以及所有和你一样的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and all of the children like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.94,0:37:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你能不能快点说完？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you mind justgetting this over with, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.61,0:37:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 因为我实在无法忍受你的独角戏了 - 真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I really can't stand the monologuing. - Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.27,0:37:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是你的作风是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's all part ofyour m.o., isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.40,0:37:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掩饰所有痛苦 掩饰所有事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masks all that nasty pain.Masks the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.00,0:37:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是吗？是什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.00,0:37:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白的 你努力 你一直在为这个家庭而努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you fight and you fightfor this family, but the truth is…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.40,0:37:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但事实是 他们根本不需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.10,0:37:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不像你需要他们那样需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like you need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.00,0:37:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 他显然才是约翰的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, he's clearly John's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.31,0:37:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使他们争吵不休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when they fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.87,0:37:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对萨姆的关心在任何时候都比对你的要多\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's more concernthan he's ever shown you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.27,0:37:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜你肯定也为你的子女骄傲 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you're real proudof your kids too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 等一下 我忘了 我废了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait, I forgot.I wasted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.77,0:38:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.81,0:38:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.78,0:38:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.60,0:38:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.97,0:38:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 不要让他杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad. Don't you let it kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.61,0:38:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.20,0:38:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.71,0:38:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.34,0:38:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't! Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.10,0:38:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.47,0:39:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了我 就杀了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill me, you kill Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.70,0:39:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.70,0:39:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 迪恩 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Dean. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.41,0:39:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 上帝 你流了很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. You lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.50,0:39:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.07,0:39:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在这 他在这 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.21,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 去看看他 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go check on him. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.00,0:39:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go check on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.87,0:39:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.37,0:39:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.04,0:39:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 它还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy! It's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.99,0:39:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还在我身体里 我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's inside me. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你射我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.27,0:39:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快射我 瞄准我的心脏 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot me. You shoot me in the heart, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.97,0:39:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开枪 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.22,0:39:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 不要 不要 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, don't you do it. Don't you do it.You gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能坚持太久 开枪吧 儿子 快开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hold onto it much longer.Just shoot me, son. Shoot me!I.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.31,0:40:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我求你了 此时此地 我们能结束一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, l'm begging you.We can end this, here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.77,0:40:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.10,0:40:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 不要 - 你必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, no. - You do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.65,0:40:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.30,0:40:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.44,0:41:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 坚持住 行吗 只要10分钟就到医院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just hold on, all right?The hospital's only 10 minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.31,0:41:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很惊讶 萨姆 你为什么不杀死它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised at you, Sammy.Why didn't you kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.37,0:41:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为对此我们早就达成共识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we saw eye to eye on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.25,0:41:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀死这个恶魔第一重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing this demon comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.97,0:41:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比我或者任何事都重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before me, before everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.21,0:41:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 父亲 那不是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.Not before everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.64,0:41:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我们还有柯尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we still got the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.34,0:41:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还有一发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have the one bullet left.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.01,0:41:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只需重头再来一次 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should start over, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.99,0:41:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经找到这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}l mean, we already found the demon once.
